{"id":"vod_sn_35981","vodId":"35981","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"忍之一时","name_cn":"忍之一时","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/183000bc05df63ad64c78e03612af0b4.jpg"},"summary":"不存在忍者。……我们这么想。就算有忍者存在，忍者也不会向我们暴露。正因为如此，忍者“表面上”是不存在的。主人公，曾经以为和我们一样没有忍者的普通男子。他被约定了普通的，幸福的光辉的日子…应该的。有一天，他被人盯上了，听说那是甲贺忍者干的好事。为什么会一度被人盯上呢那是…因为他是名副其实的伊贺忍者第19代正当继承人!伊贺和甲贺长年对立，甲贺想侵略伊贺。为了活下去……自己也只能成为忍者!就这样，投身于谁也不知道的忍者世界的一时。尽量和独当一面的忍者学习，战斗，面对苦难。但是，那只是暂时所经历的残酷命运的序章…。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:22","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Dp18zENwtM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gxaQzENbP51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p3xqHxJiKP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G4WY0V7WxQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QE0vijnSUH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A92uQgae0m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YKFAGUJAe01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9pxF0LNd4H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vY9vVFrM2k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9pgX4bXvCV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EQ21pmu74P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XFEyyzrp661/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:28.325Z"}